	<string>OnePlace needs full Reminders access to sync Organizer tasks with your OnePlace Tasks list.</string>
	<key>NSRemindersUsageDescription</key>
	<string>OnePlace syncs Organizer tasks with your OnePlace Tasks list in Apple Reminders.</string>
